{"id":"wb-7-1792","name":"洛阳西工兵营","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"洛阳西工兵营","text":"洛阳西工兵营，位于今中华人民共和国河南省洛阳市西工区的一座近代新式兵营，始建于1914年。几经变迁后，现存建筑由司令部四合院、高级住宅、惜阴书室、老吴桥和阅兵台等组成，为全国重点文物保护单位、中国20世纪建筑遗产。2021年，依托西工兵营旧址建成洛阳抗战纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E9%98%B3%E8%A5%BF%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B5%E8%90%A5","revisionId":94156792,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94156792","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7214e50ff56dbe9db550b859.jpg","title":"20241215_Luoyang_Xigong_Barrack_07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241215_Luoyang_Xigong_Barrack_07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/20241215_Luoyang_Xigong_Barrack_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​洛阳西工兵营 - 吴佩孚司令部","width":320,"height":213}}